# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Read this before you commit.
#
#  This pipeline scrapes real listings and drafts real emails, so it generates
#  two kinds of data that must never reach a remote:
#    1. YOUR personal data — name, phone, email, application documents.
#    2. THIRD PARTIES' personal data — letting agents' names, work emails and
#       phone numbers, scraped from listing pages. Republishing that is a
#       Swiss FADP / GDPR problem regardless of who can see the repo.
#
#  Everything under data/, dossier/ and config/applicant.yaml is therefore
#  ignored wholesale. Prefer widening an ignore rule over committing "just one"
#  file out of those trees.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Your identity ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Name, phone, email. The committed .example alongside it is the template.
config/applicant.yaml

# ── Scraped + generated data (contains third-party contact details) ────────
# The whole tree is ignored; .gitkeep files re-create the structure on clone.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/.gitkeep

# ── Application documents (passport, Betreibungsauszug, payslips) ──────────
dossier/**
!dossier/.gitkeep
!dossier/README.md

# ── Filled-in agency application forms (your full personal details) ───────
forms/

# ── Reference photos for the vision scorer ─────────────────────────────────
style/good/**
style/bad/**
!style/good/.gitkeep
!style/bad/.gitkeep

# ── Python ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# ── macOS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store

# ── Local editor / agent session state ─────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.superpowers/
.obsidian/
